{"id":"strecke","lemma":"Strecke","pos":"noun","rank":2481,"glosses":["stretch","route","line segment"],"ipa":"/ˈʃtʁɛkə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f1/De-at-Strecke.ogg/De-at-Strecke.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Strecke","plural":"Strecken"},"examples":[{"text":"Vögel fliegen lange Strecken.","en":"Birds fly long distances.","words":[{"g":"a bird","l":"Vogel"},{"g":"to fly"},{"g":"long, for a long time"},null]},{"text":"Nicht die Hand aus dem Fenster strecken!","en":"Don't put your hand out the window.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"hand"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"window"},null]},{"text":"Gib nicht auf halber Strecke auf!","en":"Don't give up halfway.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756629","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"a half-hour before","l":"halb"},null,{"g":"on"}]},{"text":"Treffen wir uns auf halber Strecke!","en":"Let's meet each other halfway.","words":[{"g":"to meet"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"a half-hour before","l":"halb"},null]},{"text":"Das ist eine erstaunliche Strecke, nicht wahr?","en":"That's an amazing distance, isn't it?","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"amazing","l":"erstaunlich"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"right?"]]}]}